{"summary":"Jigsaw Puzzles with 2400+ photos! Create puzzles from your photos!","description":"Jigsaw Puzzles that is a <b>really free</b> jigsaw game! The puzzle that gives you the perfect <b>real Jigsaw </b> experience, like if you were playing with real pieces, but don't risk losing any piece!\n\nEverything in the game is free!\n• All <b>2400 photos</b> are free!\n• Create custom jigsaw puzzles <b>from your album</b> photos? Also free.\n• Pick any number of pieces and rotation - free also.\nNo need to pay to unlock photos or premium version.\n\nAnd more:\n• <b>Puzzles sizes</b>: From 9 pieces (novice player) to 1300 pieces (expert puzzle).\n• <b>Your Own Photos</b>: Play with any family photo you have on your phone or tablet!\n• <b>More Photos</b>: Over 2400 free photos in 35 themes.\n• <b>Unique Puzzle</b>: Each piece forms an unique jigsaw design.\n\nThere's a vast amount of free photo puzzles packs, such as: beach puzzles, mountain, castle, pet images, cats and dogs puzzles, Halloween, etc.\n\nPermission to Read storage/Album: this permission is optional, it will only be asked if you try to create a puzzle from your album photos.\n\nPlease send your suggestions and problem reports to our puzzle-masters: jigsaw.and@rottzgames.com \n\nOver 300 MILLION free puzzles played! Thanks for loving Jigsaw Puzzles!\n\nEnjoy!","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$7.49 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-0n4KSBsuXo?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5_miGubx1S8PAJC43_QF2et3q82rCb1jk_xJIfoyI4RAsKHkfYnVDvZfliCOerVqy6-ndQUpW-MiWfpCcFjPQi8","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0GPfDkjT8COdfnXaqsJiPpz8jC1PZG9DME3d2xGe7UfCQE8Aqeu5HxszrkLBzF3Yt1t6iDgLHEVtRa0kdVO2og","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/uZPaF_dnUQG9a_f2kwd-6cjXn9iRHsmcCaMDxsCW2Q-3nPBlOf49zUUU8f4sg10qcAnX4E7xqt0ejdD3Tftid20","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/6IRkaEKCug53N_fWhRW2jtFeNzUPcTVHx4hSSEaQrbJeY4NeAeAkL_LBc72x